<body>
    <div type="letter"><pb facs="3713741" n="311r"/>
  <opener><lb/>Excellentissimo Joh. BERNOULLIO <lb/>Joh. Gesnerus s. pl. d.</opener>
  <p><lb/>Cito humanitate tua Amicissime Bernoulli co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>ittendo tu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <lb/>cur<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> quos ex Bibliotheca Steheliniana libros desidera verim: deprecor <lb/>eam molestiam. Ob discessum Tabellarium brevis esse cogor, <lb/>alia vice plenior futurus. De Maclaurini <del><gap/></del>Introd. in <lb/>Doctrinam fluctionum moneo ejus pretium esse Parisiis 20 <lb/>Interque <add>De Pezenas</add> palam ab Academia Scientiarum ob merita in analysin lau<lb break="no"/>datur. Introductio in Analysin v. decimum sub prelo cudat.</p>
  <closer><lb/>Vale, saluta nobiliss. familiam &amp; à nobis pl. salutatus <lb/>vole. Raptissime d. 28. Oct. 1750</closer><pb facs="3713742" n="311v" type="empty"/>
</div>
</body>
